description: |
    The :ref:`/plugins/prepare/install` plugin gained a new ``reboot``
    key (``--reboot`` on the command line) which reboots the guest after
    package installation, for example to boot into a freshly installed
    kernel. The reboot is skipped when no package was actually installed,
    image mode guests reuse the reboot performed by the ``bootc`` image
    switch, and the option is not supported on ``local``, ``container``
    and ``mock`` guests.
